    "id": "p32-challenge-q2-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "2",
    "prompt": "Express $x^4+4$ as the product of two quadratic polynomials with integer coefficients.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$(x^2-2x+2)(x^2+2x+2)$\n\nAdd and subtract $4x^2$, then factorise a difference of squares.",
      "worked": "Add and subtract $4x^2$ to form a perfect square.\n$$\\begin{align*}x^4+4&=x^4+4x^2+4-4x^2\\\\x^4+4&=(x^2+2)^2-(2x)^2\\\\x^4+4&=(x^2+2-2x)(x^2+2+2x)\\\\x^4+4&=(x^2-2x+2)(x^2+2x+2).\n\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
